    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I can't take another step...&quot; You've collapsed from the crushing daily grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your consciousness fades, and darkness envelops your vision. And then, you find yourself before a towering mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I said I couldn't walk another step, but I never said I couldn't climb.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins your long and arduous ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry. After all, you can use your hands and feet for this climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses mouse input only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag your limbs to scale the treacherous mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you let go with both hands, you'll fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feet can't grip rocks, but you can convert their pushing power into climbing force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly intuitive, standard climbing style.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends and encourage each other as you climb together.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up in-game currency to purchase a variety of avatars from the shop.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite from over 100 avatars!</p>[/]</ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and corporations alike may stream this game without needing prior permission.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only permitted using the features provided by the video streaming platform.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We request that you include the game's name in the title of your videos/streams and a link to our Steam page in the description.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we assume no responsibility for any damages incurred as a result of streaming this game.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</p>[/]</ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version Details</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play up to a certain point in Area 2 of the full game.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with players of the full version is supported.</p>[/]</ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I can't take another step...&quot; You've collapsed from the crushing daily grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your consciousness fades, and darkness envelops your vision. And then, you find yourself before a towering mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I said I couldn't walk another step, but I never said I couldn't climb.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins your long and arduous ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry. After all, you can use your hands and feet for this climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses mouse input only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag your limbs to scale the treacherous mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you let go with both hands, you'll fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feet can't grip rocks, but you can convert their pushing power into climbing force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly intuitive, standard climbing style.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends and encourage each other as you climb together.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up in-game currency to purchase a variety of avatars from the shop.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite from over 100 avatars!</p>[/]</ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and corporations alike may stream this game without needing prior permission.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only permitted using the features provided by the video streaming platform.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We request that you include the game's name in the title of your videos/streams and a link to our Steam page in the description.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we assume no responsibility for any damages incurred as a result of streaming this game.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</p>[/]</ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version Details</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play up to a certain point in Area 2 of the full game.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with players of the full version is supported.</p>[/]</ul>",
    "short_description": "Overworked drone, conquer your nightmare ascent! The path is brutally steep and agonizingly long. But take heart! At least for this climb, you've got hands and feet.",
